00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:09.000
And here's a quick run through
of how our satellites operate.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.420
We have upwards of 130
satellites operating

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:17.700
in a sun-synchronous polar
orbit that image the Earth like

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.970
a line scanner.

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.400
Our flagship Dove constellation
allows for broad area

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.080
